  <jpcrp_cor:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpensesIncludedInGeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesAndManufacturingCostForCurrentPeriodTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;※４．一般管理費に含まれる研究開発費の総額は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
